---
import TrustLayout from '../../layouts/TrustLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
const title = 'Contact | Utilitas';
const description = 'Where to send project feedback, accessibility reports, corrections, and security concerns for Utilitas tools.';
---

<TrustLayout title={title} description={description} path="/contact/" eyebrow="Get in touch">
  <h2>Choose the closest route</h2>
  <p>Feedback is easiest to evaluate when it reaches the project it concerns. Include the product name, affected URL, browser and device when relevant, what you expected, and what happened.</p>

  <div class="contact-options">
    <section>
      <h3>Utilitas hub</h3>
      <p>For general feedback, corrections, privacy questions, and accessibility reports about this hub, email the dedicated contact address.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Project Quantity Lab</h3>
      <p>For calculator feedback, correction details, and accessibility reports, use the project's dedicated address.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@home.utilitas.app">contact@home.utilitas.app</a>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Photo Privacy Lab</h3>
      <p>For product feedback, privacy questions, and accessibility reports, use the project's dedicated address. Do not attach sensitive source images or metadata.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@exif.utilitas.app">contact@exif.utilitas.app</a>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Mortgage Compass</h3>
      <p>For calculator feedback, housing-data corrections, and accessibility reports, use the shared Utilitas contact address. Do not include personal financial information.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>SVG Vector Lab</h3>
      <p>Use the project's maintained contact page for editor feedback, SVG problems, corrections, and accessibility reports.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://svgvectorlab.com/contact/">SVG Vector Lab contact <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </div>

  <h2>Security and privacy reports</h2>
  <p>For security concerns, follow the relevant project policy before opening a public issue. The hub's current reporting contact and policy are also published in <a href="/.well-known/security.txt"><code>security.txt</code></a>. For privacy questions, describe the affected site and data flow without including unnecessary personal information.</p>

  <h2>Email, not an intake form</h2>
  <p>The hub deliberately avoids a contact form. Selecting an email link opens your own mail application, and your message is handled by your email provider and the receiving mailbox rather than stored by a Utilitas form.</p>
</TrustLayout>
